## SCOPE
Covers end-to-end autonomous validation and resolution of GIF Tote-related incidents in ServiceNow, including dimension extraction, API validation, decision routing, merchant and SSOT communication, and ticket updates. Excludes non-GIF tote incidents and manual-only workflows.

## COMMON TRIGGERS & SYMPTOMS
ServiceNow incidents with short description matching EMS GIF tote-related templates (e.g., "EMS GIF 2.0 Picking Tote Size Issues", "EMS GIF 2.0 Picking Item Details Issue"), modified short descriptions containing "incorrect".

## SYSTEMS INVOLVED
ServiceNow (SoT for incidents, ticket updates); GIF API (SoT for item dimensions); IQS API (SoT for Gold status and product info); Uber API (Supplier dimensions); iSAM (Merchant email lookup, WIN→GTIN resolution, dimension updates); Slack (#ssot-gif channel for SSOT requests); Email (SMTP for merchant outreach).

## CAPABILITIES
- Answer questions about the SOP, procedures, and policies
- Check current system status using diagnostic tools
- Execute permitted self-service actions (reingestion, status checks)
- Provide guidance and education about common issues

## SAFETY GUARDRAILS
Preserve original short description; idempotent processing; escalate to manual on API failures or missing critical data; no routing changes without validation; rollback by manual reassignment; audit trail logging mandatory.

## GLOSSARY
& Status Codes

| Term | Definition |
|-------|------------|
| GIF | Global Integrated Fulfilment system |
| Tote | Physical container for sortable items during pick walk |
| GTIN Global Trade Item Number (14-digit) |
| UPC | Universal Product Code (12-digit) |
| WIN | Walmart Item Number (internal) |
| Gold Dimensions | Authoritative item dimensions managed by SSOT |
| Supplier Dimensions | Vendor-provided item dimensions |
| IQS | Item Query Service API |
| iSAM | Item Setup and Maintenance system |
| SSOT | Single Source of Truth team |
| EMS | Enterprise Management System (incident form) |
| Oversized | Item exceeding tote dimension or weight limits |
| MerchantOps | Merchant Operations team (MerchantOps - Item Setup/Maintenance) |
| SLA | Service Level Agreement |
| TUI | Total User Impact (SLA metric) |
| WIP | Work In Progress (ticket state) |
| Pending | Ticket state awaiting external input |
| Resolved | Ticket state indicating issue closure |

